---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Welcome"
  description="Your subscription to Copes Corner is confirmed."
  lang="en"
>
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex" />

  <div class="welcome-content">
    <h1>Welcome to Copes Corner</h1>

    <p>Your subscription is confirmed. Thanks for subscribing.</p>

    <p>
      I spend a lot of time noticing how things really work. At work, on basketball courts, at home with kids, and in the routines that shape our days. This is where I put those observations.
    </p>

    <p>
      A new post will arrive every second Sunday. It is short. It is meant to be read in a few minutes and then left alone. That's the aim.
    </p>

    <p>
      If it lands in Promotions, drag it to Primary so you don't miss the next one.
    </p>

    <p class="starter-intro">Here are three to start with:</p>

    <ul class="starter-list">
      <li><a href="/blog/the-present/">The Present</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/the-first-draft/">The First Draft</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/one-breath/">One Breath</a></li>
    </ul>

    <p>You can reply to any email from me. I read everything.</p>

    <p class="signoff">Craig</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .welcome-content {
    padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #6b7645;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }

  .starter-intro {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .starter-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .starter-list li {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
  }

  .starter-list a {
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #6b7645;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .starter-list a:hover,
  .starter-list a:focus-visible {
    color: #515a33;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }

  .signoff {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .starter-list a {
      color: #7a9e68;
    }

    .starter-list a:hover,
    .starter-list a:focus-visible {
      color: #96b885;
    }
  }
</style>
